        <p>It does not amplify force — it steadies it. White Coral supports courage that is calm, action that is measured, and energy that is directed rather than scattered. It helps reduce impulsiveness, restlessness, and internal agitation, replacing them with composure and control.</p>
        <p>White Coral aligns with Mars’s energy to promote grounded strength, discipline, and steady progress. It encourages patience, builds resilience, and supports decision-making that is thoughtful rather than reactive.</p>
        <p>It is particularly suited for individuals who feel easily agitated, emotionally reactive, or overwhelmed by intensity — as well as those who find Red Coral too strong and seek a gentler form of Mars support.</p>
