        <p>Moonstone aligns with the Moon’s energy to promote emotional harmony, clarity of thought, and inner peace. It encourages softness, composure, and a more balanced response to life’s experiences, especially during periods of stress or emotional sensitivity.</p>
        <p>It is particularly suited for individuals in creative, healing, and intuitive roles — as well as those experiencing anxiety, emotional fluctuations, or disturbed sleep. It may also be considered during Chandra Mahadasha or Antardasha when emotional stability becomes essential.</p>
